# ===== Unity 工程专用 .gitignore =====
# 由管家生成。Library 等目录是 Unity 本地缓存，提交上去会让仓库体积爆炸。

# --- Unity 自动生成 ---
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset 目录下也会生成临时文件
/Assets/AssetStoreTools*
/Assets/StreamingAssets/aa.meta
/Assets/StreamingAssets/aa/*

# --- IDE / 工程文件（Unity 会自动重建） ---
/[Aa]ssets/[Pp]lugins/[Ee]ditor/JetBrains*
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.VC.db

# --- 系统垃圾 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.bak
*.swp

# --- 打包产物 ---
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app
/[Ee]xported[Oo]bj/
*.zip

# --- 构建缓存 ---
/[Bb]uild[Ll]ogs/
crashlytics-build.properties
sysinfo.txt

# --- 例外：这些必须提交（Unity 靠它们认资源引用） ---
!*.meta
!/[Aa]ssets/**
